# oracle: an NVE run of a triclinic fcc lattice with pairs at the cutoff: reneighboring and sorting in lamda
units real
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 4.0
region box prism 0 4 0 4 0 4 0.5 0.3 0.2
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 39.948
mass 2 83.798
pair_style lj/cut 8.0
pair_coeff 1 1 0.238 3.405
pair_coeff 2 2 0.317 3.6
pair_coeff 1 2 0.275 3.5
thermo_style custom step pe press
thermo_modify format float %.15g
velocity all create 300 4411 loop geom
fix 1 all nve
thermo 20
run 100
